Reliability and accuracy improvements for automatic drive tracking.

- Drives upload over a more reliable connection, so long trips with the app in the background no longer stall.
- A phone sitting still with weak GPS no longer draws a zigzag or adds miles you did not drive.
- Trip distances are more accurate on drives that start before the signal settles.
- The app now reports why it stopped if the phone shuts it down, so problems can be diagnosed instead of guessed at.
